+- exp4301 `results/experiment_4301_capstone_v397.json` (blocked)
+- exp4291 (cross-generator, the real win) + exp4293 audit
+  (`docs/research-notes/exp4293-in-generation-moat-degenerate-controls-audit-2026-06-16.md`)
